    "innovation": "This paper introduces a data-driven, optimized afforestation strategy for Europe that simultaneously reduces peak river discharges by up to 43% and limits evapotranspiration losses by 60% compared to non-optimized approaches, demonstrating a method to enhance both climate mitigation and water sustainability.",
